871
00:31:46,763 --> 00:31:49,033
(Feeling sad)

872
00:31:49,933 --> 00:31:51,543
- Hee Min. - Yes?

873
00:31:51,843 --> 00:31:55,672
It's time to take Alkong and Dalkong home.

874
00:31:55,673 --> 00:31:57,942
- Is it time to pick them up? - Yes, it's time to pick them up.

875
00:31:57,943 --> 00:31:59,042
You can stop working now.

876
00:31:59,043 --> 00:32:01,582
- Shall I stop? - Yes. We need to pick them up.

877
00:32:01,583 --> 00:32:03,812
- You need to pick them up. - Really?

878
00:32:03,813 --> 00:32:05,383
Thank you for your hard work today.

879
00:32:05,523 --> 00:32:07,322
I was going to work until sunset.

880
00:32:07,323 --> 00:32:08,692
Until sunset?

881
00:32:08,693 --> 00:32:09,822
You've done a lot of work.

882
00:32:09,823 --> 00:32:11,662
- I know. - I was determined to work.

883
00:32:11,663 --> 00:32:14,362
They said that they needed help, so I was going to work all day long.

884
00:32:14,363 --> 00:32:15,433
You've done a lot of work.

885
00:32:15,863 --> 00:32:17,703
It was hard for me to go to the kindergarten.

886
00:32:18,633 --> 00:32:19,832
You preferred working.

887
00:32:19,833 --> 00:32:21,173
- You preferred working. - Yes, I preferred working.

888
00:32:22,373 --> 00:32:24,742
- I moved a lot of rocks, - Okay.

889
00:32:24,743 --> 00:32:25,902
but it doesn't show.

890
00:32:25,903 --> 00:32:27,343
This is outstanding work.

891
00:32:27,573 --> 00:32:28,573
It has become prettier.

892
00:32:28,574 --> 00:32:30,173
- Yes, it has. - The field has become bigger.

893
00:32:30,573 --> 00:32:32,883
(Before restoration)

894
00:32:34,243 --> 00:32:37,782
(After restoration)

895
00:32:37,783 --> 00:32:39,183
It couldn't have been easy.

896
00:32:42,623 --> 00:32:43,893
You did well.

897
00:32:44,993 --> 00:32:47,093
- I'll come back to move rocks. - Please come again.

898
00:32:47,223 --> 00:32:49,232
- Thank you for your hard work. - Call me tomorrow.

899
00:32:49,233 --> 00:32:50,533
Take care. Let's meet again.

900
00:32:51,563 --> 00:32:54,573
