901
00:32:55,203 --> 00:32:57,433
(Opening)

902
00:32:59,773 --> 00:33:00,842
Hello.

903
00:33:00,843 --> 00:33:02,143
- Hello. - Hello.

904
00:33:03,643 --> 00:33:05,242
- Yes? - Alkong and Dalkong's guardians...

905
00:33:05,243 --> 00:33:06,243
are here.

906
00:33:06,383 --> 00:33:08,183
- Okay. They're going downstairs. - Okay.

907
00:33:08,753 --> 00:33:09,853
There they are.

908
00:33:10,413 --> 00:33:12,082
My goodness.

909
00:33:12,083 --> 00:33:13,352
My goodness.

910
00:33:13,353 --> 00:33:15,393
- How cute! - My goodness.

911
00:33:15,453 --> 00:33:17,993
There are no other beings like dogs.

912
00:33:18,763 --> 00:33:20,892
- I'll take their backpacks. - My goodness.

913
00:33:20,893 --> 00:33:22,532
- Thank you. - Gosh.

914
00:33:22,533 --> 00:33:23,993
- Wait. - Gosh.

915
00:33:24,703 --> 00:33:26,862
- Dogs are always happy to see you. - Right.

916
00:33:26,863 --> 00:33:29,632
How cute! Did you have fun?

917
00:33:29,633 --> 00:33:31,942
- Mom, give him to me. - Did you have fun?

918
00:33:31,943 --> 00:33:33,703
Go to your brother.

919
00:33:34,143 --> 00:33:36,373
- Go to your brother. - How cute.

920
00:33:37,143 --> 00:33:38,383
- The leash. - My goodness.

921
00:33:39,213 --> 00:33:40,813
Hold on to the leash.

922
00:33:41,583 --> 00:33:43,152
- Well done. - What did they learn today?

923
00:33:43,153 --> 00:33:44,212
- What did they learn? - Yes.

924
00:33:44,213 --> 00:33:46,523
Today, they learned how to walk next to the teacher...

925
00:33:46,753 --> 00:33:48,252
instead of outrunning the teacher.

926
00:33:48,253 --> 00:33:49,552
They learned how to sit, lie down,

927
00:33:49,553 --> 00:33:50,822
- Sit and lie down? - stand,

928
00:33:50,823 --> 00:33:53,293
wait, and come when called.

929
00:33:53,593 --> 00:33:55,432
Will they listen to our commands?

930
00:33:55,433 --> 00:33:56,532
Of course.

931
00:33:56,533 --> 00:33:59,162
- They learned how to wait here. - Really?

932
00:33:59,163 --> 00:34:00,833
They learned the command here.

933
00:34:01,333 --> 00:34:02,573
There you go.

934
00:34:03,233 --> 00:34:05,442
There you go.

935
00:34:05,443 --> 00:34:07,403
- You can use the same commands. - Okay.

936
00:34:07,813 --> 00:34:09,213
- Thank you. - Thank you.

937
00:34:09,643 --> 00:34:11,442
- Let's go. - There you go.

938
00:34:11,443 --> 00:34:12,483
Let's go.

939
00:34:13,383 --> 00:34:15,452
- You're so cute. - The leash.

940
00:34:15,453 --> 00:34:16,682
Thank you. Take care.

941
00:34:16,683 --> 00:34:18,452
- Have a nice weekend. - Take care.

942
00:34:18,453 --> 00:34:20,323
- Thank you for your hard work. - Take care.

943
00:34:20,983 --> 00:34:23,192
(They get into the car with Alkong and Dalkong.)

944
00:34:23,193 --> 00:34:24,862
- Let's go. - Let's go.

945
00:34:24,863 --> 00:34:27,323
They had a good time at the kindergarten.

946
00:34:28,093 --> 00:34:29,163
Let's go.

947
00:34:32,833 --> 00:34:34,203
