They used to avoid me.

950
00:34:40,073 --> 00:34:41,543
- Now, they're leaning on my arms. - Right.

951
00:34:41,843 --> 00:34:43,642
- They don't bark at you anymore. - Yesterday,

952
00:34:43,643 --> 00:34:45,242
they treated me like a thief.

953
00:34:45,243 --> 00:34:46,513
(They treated me like a thief.)

954
00:34:46,713 --> 00:34:49,713
They realized that you weren't a bad person.

955
00:34:50,713 --> 00:34:53,223
(Let's be friends.)

956
00:34:57,293 --> 00:34:59,263
