No.

958
00:35:00,563 --> 00:35:01,633
We're here.

959
00:35:05,133 --> 00:35:06,563
You guys are coming with me.

960
00:35:07,303 --> 00:35:09,203
The leash. Here.

961
00:35:09,603 --> 00:35:12,502
I don't see them very often.

962
00:35:12,503 --> 00:35:15,512
- Will you walk them? - I wanted to do something for them.

963
00:35:15,513 --> 00:35:16,943
