971
00:35:32,323 --> 00:35:34,563
He finally found a fellow runner.

972
00:35:35,193 --> 00:35:37,392
- Proper Run Crew. - Proper Run Crew.

973
00:35:37,393 --> 00:35:38,533
- He is good. - Proper Run Crew.

974
00:35:38,903 --> 00:35:40,733
You're walking well with your big brother.

975
00:35:41,433 --> 00:35:42,573
