976
00:35:43,233 --> 00:35:44,373
Where are you going?

977
00:35:44,973 --> 00:35:47,343
Go ahead. Go where you want to go.

978
00:35:48,313 --> 00:35:51,283
(Kian84 runs with him.)

979
00:35:51,843 --> 00:35:54,143
(Happy)

980
00:35:54,483 --> 00:35:56,083
Dalkong, let's run as well.

981
00:35:56,553 --> 00:35:58,023
Dalkong, let's run as well.

982
00:35:58,453 --> 00:36:00,253
You're running well.

983
00:36:00,583 --> 00:36:01,923
That's good.

984
00:36:02,253 --> 00:36:03,922
Aren't you happy to take a walk with your big brother?

985
00:36:03,923 --> 00:36:05,262
(I want to run some more!)

986
00:36:05,263 --> 00:36:06,423
Let's run with them.

987
00:36:07,193 --> 00:36:09,592
- Let's run! - Come here!

988
00:36:09,593 --> 00:36:10,732
Let's run!

989
00:36:10,733 --> 00:36:12,603
(This time, they run together with Kian84.)

990
00:36:12,963 --> 00:36:16,573
(Let's run.)

991
00:36:17,333 --> 00:36:20,673
(The three siblings race freely across the field.)

992
00:36:22,073 --> 00:36:23,243
They're running well.

993
00:36:23,673 --> 00:36:24,683
All right.

994
00:36:26,243 --> 00:36:28,212
(This is nice.)

995
00:36:28,213 --> 00:36:29,253
How cute!

996
00:36:29,783 --> 00:36:31,282
When you do that, the outfit...

997
00:36:31,283 --> 00:36:33,523
- Hello. - Hello.

998
00:36:34,253 --> 00:36:35,852
- What? - Hello.

999
00:36:35,853 --> 00:36:37,223
- Did you book a photo session? - Hello.

1000
00:36:37,493 --> 00:36:38,562
Nice to meet you.

1001
00:36:38,563 --> 00:36:39,922
They're Alkong and Dalkong.

1002
00:36:39,923 --> 00:36:43,563
With the dog that passed away,

1003
00:36:43,833 --> 00:36:45,433
Candy,

1004
00:36:45,663 --> 00:36:47,662
