1005
00:36:47,663 --> 00:36:49,432
(We had a family portrait.)

1006
00:36:49,433 --> 00:36:50,573
We had it.

1007
00:36:51,503 --> 00:36:53,773
In retrospect,

1008
00:36:54,043 --> 00:36:56,273
only that photo remains.

1009
00:36:56,943 --> 00:36:58,782
It has been about four months...

1010
00:36:58,783 --> 00:37:00,683
since the dogs became a family.

1011
00:37:01,913 --> 00:37:05,053
I decided to get our photos taken at the canola flower field...

1012
00:37:06,353 --> 00:37:07,483
and went there.

1013
00:37:08,393 --> 00:37:10,393
Please stand close.

1014
00:37:11,023 --> 00:37:12,522
Gosh, there you go.

1015
00:37:12,523 --> 00:37:13,792
- You're doing a great job. - That's it.

1016
00:37:13,793 --> 00:37:15,063
How cute!

1017
00:37:15,733 --> 00:37:17,392
I'll take photos like this.

1018
00:37:17,393 --> 00:37:18,403
(It's okay.)

1019
00:37:19,033 --> 00:37:21,273
- How cute! - Look over here.

1020
00:37:21,433 --> 00:37:22,603
(Hold on.)

1021
00:37:22,903 --> 00:37:24,232
