1023
00:37:25,973 --> 00:37:27,542
Smile. In 1, 2, 3.

1024
00:37:27,543 --> 00:37:28,573
Smile like this.

1025
00:37:28,673 --> 00:37:30,713
- That's it. In 1, 2, 3. - In 1, 2, 3.

1026
00:37:31,943 --> 00:37:33,583
Alkong and Dalkong, look here.

1027
00:37:33,643 --> 00:37:35,252
One more time. Stay still.

1028
00:37:35,253 --> 00:37:36,913
I have a pollen allergy.

1029
00:37:37,013 --> 00:37:38,722
- Really? - The canola flowers...

1030
00:37:38,723 --> 00:37:39,823
