1031
00:37:40,723 --> 00:37:42,122
- Stay. - Stay.

1032
00:37:42,123 --> 00:37:44,153
- Stay. - I'll take a photo of this.

1033
00:37:44,293 --> 00:37:45,323
- Good. - Stay.

1034
00:37:45,763 --> 00:37:46,863
All right.

